  "description": "WAVES is a web application dedicated to bioinformatic tool integration. It provides an efficient way to implement a service for any bioinformatic software. Such services are automatically made available in three ways: web pages, web forms to include in remote websites, and a RESTful web services API to access remotely from applications. In order to fulfill the service\u2019s computational needs, WAVES can perform computation on various resources and environments, such as Galaxy instances.",
